{"ref":"BDB, מִקְנָה","hw":"מִקְנָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְנָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. purchase</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 23:18\" href=\"/Genesis.23.18\">Gn 23:18</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְנַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:12\" href=\"/Genesis.17.12\">Gn 17:12</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְנָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.16\">Lv 25:16</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>purchase</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְנַת כֶּסֶף</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:12\" href=\"/Genesis.17.12\">Gn 17:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:13\" href=\"/Genesis.17.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:23\" href=\"/Genesis.17.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:27\" href=\"/Genesis.17.27\">27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:44\" href=\"/Exodus.12.44\">Ex 12:44</a> (all P); <span dir=\"rtl\">סֵפֶר הַמּ׳</span> <em>document of purchase</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.11\">Je 32:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.12\">12</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.16\">16</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  2, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.16\">Lv 25:16</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:51\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.51\">51</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.22\">27:22</a> (P).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>possession</em> (gained by purchase), <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמִקְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 23:18\" href=\"/Genesis.23.18\">Gn 23:18</a> (P).","next":"BDB, מִקְנֵיָ֫הוּ","prev":"BDB, מִקְנֶה²"}